            "title": "العلاقة",
            "explanation": "",
            "latex": "v_{n+1}=\\frac{u_{n+1}}{2^{n+1}}+3=\\frac12\\left(\\frac{u_n}{2^n}+3\\right)=\\frac12v_n"
